       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. ORDHIER1.
       AUTHOR. SYNTHETIC-CORPUS.
      * CATEGORY B: DATA HIERARCHY - MULTI-TIER ORDER ENTITY TREE (01, 05, 10, OCCURS)
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  PURCHASE-ORDER-ENTITY.
           05  PO-HEADER.
               10  PO-NUMBER           PIC X(12) VALUE 'PO-2026-8801'.
               10  ORDER-DATE          PIC 9(8) VALUE 20260915.
               10  STATUS-CODE         PIC X(4) VALUE 'NEW'.
           05  PO-BUYER-INFO.
               10  BUYER-ID            PIC X(8) VALUE 'BYR-0412'.
               10  DEPARTMENT-CODE     PIC X(6) VALUE 'FINOPS'.
               10  APPROVAL-LIMIT      PIC 9(7)V99 VALUE 0025000.00.
           05  PO-LINE-ITEMS.
               10  LINE-COUNT          PIC 9(2) VALUE 03.
               10  LINE-ITEM OCCURS 5 TIMES.
                   15  SKU-ID          PIC X(8).
                   15  ITEM-DESCRIPTION PIC X(20).
                   15  QUANTITY-ORDERED PIC 9(4).
                   15  UNIT-COST-AMOUNT PIC 9(5)V99.
                   15  EXTENDED-LINE-VAL PIC 9(7)V99.
           05  PO-SHIPPING-CONTAINER.
               10  CARRIER-CODE        PIC X(4) VALUE 'FDXG'.
               10  ESTIMATED-FREIGHT   PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE 00125.50.
               10  IS-INSURED-SHIPMENT PIC X(1) VALUE 'Y'.
           05  PO-FINANCIAL-TOTALS.
               10  SUBTOTAL-MERCH      PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 00000000.00.
               10  TAX-SURCHARGE-AMT   PIC 9(6)V99 VALUE 000000.00.
               10  GRAND-TOTAL-AMOUNT  PIC 9(8)V99 VALUE 00000000.00.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-PROCESS-PURCHASE-ORDER.
           PERFORM 1000-POPULATE-SAMPLE-LINES
           PERFORM 2000-CALCULATE-LINE-EXTENSIONS
           PERFORM 3000-COMPUTE-GRAND-TOTAL
           GOBACK.

       1000-POPULATE-SAMPLE-LINES.
           MOVE 'SKU-001' TO SKU-ID(1)
           MOVE 'SERVER BLADE RACK' TO ITEM-DESCRIPTION(1)
           MOVE 2 TO QUANTITY-ORDERED(1)
           MOVE 3200.00 TO UNIT-COST-AMOUNT(1)
           MOVE 'SKU-002' TO SKU-ID(2)
           MOVE 'OPTICAL TRANSCEIVER' TO ITEM-DESCRIPTION(2)
           MOVE 8 TO QUANTITY-ORDERED(2)
           MOVE 150.00 TO UNIT-COST-AMOUNT(2)
           MOVE 'SKU-003' TO SKU-ID(3)
           MOVE 'PATCH CABLE PACK' TO ITEM-DESCRIPTION(3)
           MOVE 5 TO QUANTITY-ORDERED(3)
           MOVE 45.00 TO UNIT-COST-AMOUNT(3).

       2000-CALCULATE-LINE-EXTENSIONS.
           COMPUTE EXTENDED-LINE-VAL(1) = QUANTITY-ORDERED(1) * UNIT-COST-AMOUNT(1)
           COMPUTE EXTENDED-LINE-VAL(2) = QUANTITY-ORDERED(2) * UNIT-COST-AMOUNT(2)
           COMPUTE EXTENDED-LINE-VAL(3) = QUANTITY-ORDERED(3) * UNIT-COST-AMOUNT(3)
           COMPUTE SUBTOTAL-MERCH = EXTENDED-LINE-VAL(1) + EXTENDED-LINE-VAL(2) + EXTENDED-LINE-VAL(3).

       3000-COMPUTE-GRAND-TOTAL.
           COMPUTE TAX-SURCHARGE-AMT = SUBTOTAL-MERCH * 0.0825
           COMPUTE GRAND-TOTAL-AMOUNT = SUBTOTAL-MERCH + TAX-SURCHARGE-AMT + ESTIMATED-FREIGHT
           IF GRAND-TOTAL-AMOUNT > APPROVAL-LIMIT
               MOVE 'REQD' TO STATUS-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 'APPR' TO STATUS-CODE
           END-IF.
